        "id": 1333748
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-09-09T18:49:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think Keith\u0027s concern here is that we\u0027ll only find these bugs in production since it\u0027s hard to test \"missed events\". I can see merits to both. Do we have a Kconfig for test/production builds? Can we do a timeout in a production build and leave it out in test builds so we still see driver bugs in our own testing?",
      "parentUuid": "a4f63c7c_37b192d8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1513,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 1513,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "c3495509791eaa42a96be07bacc93bbe90776987",
